    "title": "Lewis Powers North Clay/Clay City Past Ramsey - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WJBD Staff ,\n15 hours ago Cooper Lewis put together a dominant performance at the plate and on the mound Tuesday, helping North Clay/Clay City cruise past Ramsey, 12-0. Lewis drove in all six of his runs during a remarkable two-inning stretch. He opened the game with a two-run home run to center field before adding a two-run double in the first inning. Lewis capped his offensive performance with a two-run triple in the second. Read full article",
